TI  - The Dual Role of Neutrophil Extracellular Traps (NETs) in Sepsis and Ischemia-Reperfusion Injury: Comparative Analysis across Murine Models.
AU  - Kiwit, Antonia
AU  - Lu, Yuqing
AU  - Lenz, Moritz
AU  - Knopf, Jasmin
AU  - Mohr, Christoph
AU  - Ledermann, Yannick
AU  - Klinke-Petrowsky, Michaela
