TI  - Volvulus of the stomach and wandering spleen after repair of congenital diaphragmatic hernia: unexpected manifestations in a neonate.
AU  - Oyachi, Noboru
AU  - Numano, Fuminori
AU  - Fukatsu, Tamami
AU  - Nemoto, Atsushi
AU  - Naito, Atsushi
