TI  - Diagnosis and treatment of splenic torsion in children: preoperative thrombocytosis predicts splenic infarction.
AU  - Wang, Zengmeng
AU  - Peng, Chunhui
AU  - Wu, Dongyang
AU  - Wang, Kai
AU  - Chen, Yajun
PY  - 2022
T2  - BMC pediatrics
