TI  - Splenic surgery: a ten years experience of a tertiary center in Turkey.
AU  - Gunes, Orgun
AU  - Bag, Yusuf Murat
AU  - Turgut, Emre
AU  - Gunes, Ajda
AU  - Sumer, Fatih
