TI  - Evaluation of a novel technique involving ultrasound-guided, temporary, percutaneous gastropexy and gastrostomy catheter placement for providing sustained gastric decompression in dogs with gastric dilatation-volvulus.
AU  - Fox-Alvarez, W Alexander
AU  - Case, J Brad
AU  - Lewis, Daniel D
AU  - Joyce, Ashley C
AU  - Cooke, Kirsten L
AU  - Toskich, Beau
