TI  - A rare case of accessory spleen torsion in a child diagnosed by ultrasound (US) and contrast-enhanced ultrasound (CEUS).
AU  - Trinci, Margherita
AU  - Ianniello, Stefania
AU  - Galluzzo, Michele
