TI  - Antenatally diagnosed right-sided stomach (dextrogastria): A rare rotational anomaly.
AU  - Versteegh, Hendt P
AU  - Adams, Stephen D
AU  - Boxall, Sally
AU  - Burge, David M
AU  - Stanton, Michael P
PY  - 2016
T2  - Journal of pediatric surgery
