TI  - A case of torsion of the wandering spleen presenting as hypersplenism and gastric fundal varices.
AU  - Irak, Kader
AU  - Esen, Irfan
AU  - Keskin, Murat
AU  - Eminler, Ahmet Tarik
AU  - Ayyildiz, Talat
AU  - Kaya, Ekrem
