TI  - Accessory spleen torsion: rare cause of acute abdomen in children and review of literature.
AU  - Impellizzeri, Pietro
AU  - Montalto, Angela S
AU  - Borruto, Francesca A
AU  - Antonuccio, Pietro
AU  - Scalfari, Gianfranco
AU  - Arena, Francesco
