TI  - Infarcted ectopic spleen presenting as retroperitoneal mass.
AU  - Amer, Hoda Zeinab
AU  - Chin, Channing
AU  - Clarke, Kevin
AU  - Heller, Debra
PY  - 2007
T2  - Journal of minimally invasive gynecology
VL  - 14
IS  - 5
