TI  - Gastric volvulus associated with congenital diaphragmatic hernia, wandering spleen, and intrathoracic left kidney: CT findings.
AU  - Pelizzo, G
AU  - Lembo, M A
AU  - Franchella, A
AU  - Giombi, A
