TI  - Exploring the Mechanism of Action of Honeybran-Fried Cimicifuga Rhizoma in the Treatment of IBS-D Based on Metabolomics and Network Pharmacology
AU  - Zhu, J.
AU  - Zou, Y.
AU  - Wu, Y.
