TI  - Heterotopic simultaneous splenic and intrauterine pregnancy after spontaneous conception and review of literature
AU  - Julania, S.
AU  - Tai, R.
PY  - 2013
T2  - Journal of Obstetrics and Gynaecology Research
VL  - 39
IS  - 1
SP  - 367
EP  - 370
