AB  - Refer to the ancient books of traditional Chinese medicine and relevant literature to introduce the idea of treating recurrent mouth sores based on the theory of phase fire. The theory of phase fire believes that phase fire is actually yang qi, and all five organs have phase fire, and it is normal to move and keep the position. If you leave the place, the burn will be delusion. If the burn does not heal, the mouth sore will be repeated. Mouth sores are all symptoms of the disease. Seeking treatment for the disease is essential. It is pointed out that the key pathogen of recurrent mouth sores is closely related to the spleen, liver, and kidney. Recurrent mouth sores are divided into spleen deficiency, phase fire floating syndrome, liver qi depression, phase fire reverse syndrome, kidney essence deficiency, phase fire syndrome. Treatment should trigger the fire to return to the position, the phase fire floating on the Astragalus Ginseng Decoction to strengthen the spleen and stomach, Duntu and stabilize the fire; For the reverse of the phase fire, Xiaochaihu Decoction is advised to soothe the liver and regulate the qi, clear the liver and diar fire; For the phase fire, Liuwei Dihuang pills and sealing marrow elixir are prescribed to tonify the kidney and fill the essence, nourish yin and reduce fire. The mouth sore will heal if the fire is in the right place. © 2025, The Author(s).
