TI  - A 26-year clinical observation of splenic auto-transplantation and oesophageal transection anastomosis: a new treatment strategy in patients with portal hypertension
AU  - ZHANG Lei
AU  - HUO Jin-shan
AU  - ZHANG Hong-wei
AU  - CHEN Ru-fu
AU  - ZHANG Jie
AU  - Obetien Mapudengo
AU  - FANG Tian-lin
